  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "@supanexus/dsh-plugin-file-explorer",
      "text": "中文 · [English](./README.en.md)\n\n在 DeepSeek Harness 里浏览、编辑工作区文件：中间列目录树 + 多标签编辑器；左侧仍是官方对话列表。\n\n仓库：[GitHub](https://github.com/supanexus/dsh-plugin-file-explorer)"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:supanexus/dsh-plugin-file-explorer#v0.1.1\n```\n\n安装后请**完全重启** `dsh web`（或 Desktop Host），并用打印的 `?token=` 地址打开。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能做什么",
      "text": "- 会话顶部 **文件** Tab：目录树 | 编辑器分栏，并固定当前会话工作目录\n- 多标签打开文件，未保存会标 dirty；`Ctrl/Cmd+S` 保存\n- Markdown 可在源码 / 预览间切换\n- 新建、重命名、删除（非空目录不能删）\n- 可选：对话里的文件路径链接直接在编辑器中打开\n- 代码编辑优先用 Monaco（jsDelivr CDN）；加载失败或超时会自动改用纯文本框"
    },
    {
      "section": "怎么用",
      "text": "1. 打开或新建一个会话\n2. 点顶部 **文件** Tab\n3. 在左侧树中浏览；双击（或点开）文件即可编辑\n4. 改完用 `Ctrl/Cmd+S` 保存\n5. 右键树节点可新建 / 重命名 / 删除\n\n外观（背景色、字号、方案）可在编辑器工具栏中调整。"
    },
    {
      "section": "可选配置",
      "text": "设置 → 插件 → **SupaNexus 文件浏览**，可热更新例如：\n\n| 项 | 含义 | 默认 |\n|----|------|------|\n| `root` | 浏览根目录 | 当前进程工作目录 |\n| `openLinksInEditor` | 对话内文件链接是否在编辑器打开 | `false` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © SupaNexus"
    },
    {
      "section": "@supanexus/dsh-plugin-file-explorer",
      "text": "[中文](./README.md) · English\n\nBrowse and edit workspace files inside DeepSeek Harness: center tree + multi-tab editor; the left sidebar keeps the official conversation list.\n\nRepo: [GitHub](https://github.com/supanexus/dsh-plugin-file-explorer)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:supanexus/dsh-plugin-file-explorer#v0.1.1\n```\n\nFully restart `dsh web` (or Desktop Host) after install, then open the printed `?token=` URL."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- Top **Files** tab: tree | editor split; pins the session working directory\n- Multi-tab editing with dirty marks; save with `Ctrl/Cmd+S`\n- Markdown source / preview toggle\n- Create, rename, delete (non-empty directories are rejected)\n- Optional: open file-path links from the conversation in the editor\n- Monaco via jsDelivr CDN, with `<textarea>` fallback on failure or timeout"
    },
    {
      "section": "How to use",
      "text": "1. Open or create a conversation\n2. Switch to the **Files** tab\n3. Browse the tree; open a file to edit\n4. Save with `Ctrl/Cmd+S`\n5. Right-click tree nodes to create / rename / delete\n\nAppearance (background, font size, saved schemes) is available from the editor toolbar."
    },
    {
      "section": "Optional config",
      "text": "Settings → Plugins → **SupaNexus file explorer** (hot-updates), for example:\n\n| Key | Meaning | Default |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| `root` | Browse root | process working directory |\n| `openLinksInEditor` | Open conversation file links in the editor | `false` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © SupaNexus"
    }
  ],
